01:01:32.490 --> 01:01:56.970
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, at least once a week, he takes me aside and tells me how he thinks we should get Miley Cyrus on the show. I do not understand this. Maybe he's into Hannah Montana? It's always Miley Cyrus, Miley Cyrus, Miley Cyrus.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《This American Life》由PRX，公共广播交易所分发给公共广播电台。像往常一样，感谢我们节目的共同创办人Torey Malatia先生。你知道，至少每周一次，他会把我拉到一边，告诉我他认为我们应该如何让Miley Cyrus上节目。我不明白这一点。也许他喜欢Hannah Montana？总是Miley Cyrus，Miley Cyrus，Miley Cyrus。

01:01:56.970 --> 01:01:59.430
<v Kirk Johnson>Don't worry. It's not like I slept with her or anything.
<v Kirk Johnson>别担心。又不是我跟她睡过还是什么的。

01:01:59.430 --> 01:02:04.430
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass。下周带着更多《This American Life》的故事回来。
